	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Meet the Members]]></title>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The cards below come from the <strong>BP Members List</strong> block. Inside it, the Members Avatar variation (linked to the profile), the Members Heading variation and two Members X Profile paragraphs, set to the <em>Location</em> and <em>Interests</em> profile fields, all read the current member. Open a member to see the X Profile variation on their BuddyPress profile page.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

